ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a school cafeteria, 50 students are eating. The cafeteria manager tells the principal that she observes most students prefer rice as their main food, and only a small part prefer noodles or steamed buns as their main food. After observing, the principal finds that only 3 students are eating noodles.\n\n[Question]\nBefore the principal observes, how many students does he guess are having rice as their main food?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before the principal observes, he guesses that 20 students are having rice as their main food.\nB. Before the principal observes, he guesses that 15 students are having rice as their main food.\nC. Before the principal observes, he guesses that 10 students are having rice as their main food.\nD. Before the principal observes, he guesses that 40 students are having rice as their main food.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.02033235096813516,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58d539aa9dc5a833d5cf8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477395643,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:56:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"af548628c4fb402dbc709e4ec970f993"}